@* A labelled subject-photo block for the CP admin
   view / pending-review pages: a heading + the streamed image, matching the
   existing `simf-walkin__id-image` block styling. Extracted so the profile
   photo (avatar) is rendered from ONE place across the Others / Visitors view
   and pending-review pages instead of a per-page copy. The caller supplies the
   resolved (cache-busted) image URL; render it only when the photo exists. *@

<div class="simf-walkin__id-image">
    <h4>@Heading</h4>
    <img src="@Src" alt="@Heading" />
</div>
